{"name": "good_delimiters", "input": "()[]{},;:", "expected": "OP_LPAREN(() OP_RPAREN()) OP_LBRACKET([) OP_RBRACKET(]) OP_LBRACE({) OP_RBRACE(}) OP_COMMA(,) OP_SEMI(;) OP_COLON(:)"}
{"name": "good_arithmetic", "input": "+ - * /", "expected": "OP_PLUS(+) OP_MINUS(-) OP_STAR(*) OP_SLASH(/)"}
